1
00:01:22,872 --> 00:01:25,747
<i>Code Blue, Neurosurgery. Code Blue.</i>

2
00:01:25,747 --> 00:01:30,652
<i>All available neurosurgery personnel
to the VIP ICU.</i>

3
00:01:30,652 --> 00:01:33,217
<i>Code Blue, Neurosurgery. Code Blue.</i>

4
00:01:33,217 --> 00:01:38,463
<i>All available neurosurgery personnel
to the VIP ICU.</i>

5
00:01:53,505 --> 00:01:55,176
Get the defib, now!

6
00:01:57,646 --> 00:01:59,198
Charge to 200.

7
00:01:59,815 --> 00:02:01,116
Clear!

8
00:02:02,484 --> 00:02:03,885
Charge to 200 again.

9
00:02:15,239 --> 00:02:18,733
<i>He's still alive.</i>

10
00:02:18,733 --> 00:02:20,335
Prep the ECMO, now.

11
00:02:20,335 --> 00:02:23,428
Page the transport team and get CS down here.

12
00:02:23,428 --> 00:02:25,372
- All hands on deck, move.
- On it.

13
00:02:25,372 --> 00:02:27,775
- Right now.
- Yes, Doctor.

14
00:02:30,772 --> 00:02:32,952
Why are you giving up already? Do more!

15
00:02:32,952 --> 00:02:35,183
Do whatever you can!

16
00:02:35,817 --> 00:02:37,475
Show some respect for the dead.

17
00:02:37,475 --> 00:02:39,721
This doesn't concern you.

18
00:02:43,792 --> 00:02:45,806
Mom!

19
00:02:45,806 --> 00:02:48,029
Mom, are you okay?

20
00:02:55,737 --> 00:02:56,805
[Il Jun's Mom]

21
00:02:58,406 --> 00:03:00,201
[Il Jun's Dad]

22
00:03:02,338 --> 00:03:03,845
<i>The person you are trying to reach
is not answering...</i>

23
00:03:03,845 --> 00:03:06,214
You just won't stop, will you...

24
00:03:13,188 --> 00:03:14,622
Doctor.

25
00:03:15,305 --> 00:03:18,993
Yeah, I need a minute alone.

26
00:03:35,639 --> 00:03:37,812
What the hell are you doing?

27
00:03:37,812 --> 00:03:38,911
Jae Seong.

28
00:03:38,911 --> 00:03:41,052
Did Jae Gyeong tell you to finish him off?

29
00:03:41,052 --> 00:03:43,851
What did you people do to my father?

30
00:03:44,686 --> 00:03:46,832
I think she injected him with sleeping pills.

31
00:03:46,832 --> 00:03:49,512
If I don't give him the antidote right now,
he's going to die.

32
00:03:49,512 --> 00:03:51,224
What are you talking about?

33
00:03:51,224 --> 00:03:53,151
Are you saying we can save him?

34
00:03:53,151 --> 00:03:55,596
I've got a faint heartbeat.

35
00:03:56,803 --> 00:03:59,901
We have to save him, no matter what.

36
00:04:03,672 --> 00:04:05,231
Are you sure?

37
00:04:05,231 --> 00:04:07,842
If you're messing with me about my father...

38
00:04:13,739 --> 00:04:15,149
Dad.

39
00:04:16,039 --> 00:04:17,288
Mr. Kang.

40
00:04:17,288 --> 00:04:18,820
Dad.

41
00:04:25,239 --> 00:04:27,093
He's breathing.

42
00:04:27,093 --> 00:04:29,096
Dad's breathing.

43
00:04:31,408 --> 00:04:34,009
I've got a pulse. We got him back.

44
00:04:34,009 --> 00:04:36,004
Dad.

45
00:04:36,004 --> 00:04:37,210
It's me.

46
00:04:37,210 --> 00:04:39,672
Jae Seong. I'm here.

47
00:04:39,672 --> 00:04:44,650
I knew you wouldn't let it end this way.

48
00:04:44,650 --> 00:04:47,982
No way you'd let
that bitch Jae Gyeong take you down.

49
00:04:50,085 --> 00:04:51,530
[Il Jun's Mom]

50
00:04:54,689 --> 00:04:56,265
[Il Jun's Mom]

51
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:01,962
Go play along with your wife.

52
00:05:03,231 --> 00:05:06,167
Make sure she believes Dad is dead.
Not a word about this.

53
00:05:06,167 --> 00:05:08,736
He passed away a short while ago.

54
00:05:08,736 --> 00:05:10,705
What exactly is your plan?

55
00:05:14,405 --> 00:05:15,910
It's time...

56
00:05:16,605 --> 00:05:19,313
I stepped up as the eldest son.

57
00:05:23,017 --> 00:05:26,291
[Unclaimed Body]

58
00:05:36,817 --> 00:05:38,278
<i>Dad, aren't you sad?</i>

59
00:05:38,278 --> 00:05:40,902
<i>Grandpa just died.</i>

60
00:05:42,672 --> 00:05:44,006
<i>Congrats, honey.</i>

61
00:05:44,006 --> 00:05:46,775
<i>You got everything you wanted.</i>

62
00:05:46,775 --> 00:05:50,529
<i>I just want the truth about how he died.</i>

63
00:05:51,446 --> 00:05:53,047
<i>Then I'll be punished.</i>

64
00:05:54,557 --> 00:05:56,551
<i>I'm the one who should be glaring.</i>

65
00:05:56,551 --> 00:05:59,487
<i>Being linked to you
has been nothing but bad luck.</i>

66
00:06:00,906 --> 00:06:02,724
<i>I swore on Dad's grave.</i>

67
00:06:02,724 --> 00:06:05,560
<i>From now on, my only sister is you.</i>

68
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,595
Dad.

69
00:06:06,595 --> 00:06:09,864
<i>And I owe you years of being a real brother.</i>

70
00:06:13,239 --> 00:06:14,735
Dad.

71
00:06:17,906 --> 00:06:19,240
Dad.

72
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,909
Just hang in there a little longer.

73
00:06:20,909 --> 00:06:22,710
You're going to pull through.

74
00:06:29,672 --> 00:06:31,219
Not again...

75
00:06:31,219 --> 00:06:33,154
He's dead.

76
00:06:44,639 --> 00:06:46,133
Bang Geul.

77
00:06:47,173 --> 00:06:48,836
Bang Geul!

78
00:06:55,377 --> 00:06:57,445
We've got an injured person over here!

79
00:06:57,445 --> 00:06:59,114
Call an ambulance!

80
00:06:59,114 --> 00:07:01,216
Ambulance!

81
00:07:01,216 --> 00:07:03,551
You can stop running now.

82
00:07:05,039 --> 00:07:07,106
Bang Geul.

83
00:07:07,106 --> 00:07:10,525
Why are you being so loud?

84
00:07:10,525 --> 00:07:13,180
You're giving me a splitting headache.

85
00:07:15,273 --> 00:07:16,831
Bang Geul.

86
00:07:44,072 --> 00:07:45,502
You're here.

87
00:07:45,502 --> 00:07:47,294
Is everyone okay?

88
00:07:50,705 --> 00:07:51,899
What happened to your head?

89
00:07:51,899 --> 00:07:53,792
Shouldn't you go to the hospital?

90
00:07:53,792 --> 00:07:56,412
They said it's just a small cut. I'm fine.

91
00:07:56,412 --> 00:07:59,379
Honestly, I thought it was really bad.

92
00:07:59,379 --> 00:08:01,310
Isn't that right?

93
00:08:04,430 --> 00:08:07,273
A second ago you were running
with her in your arms

94
00:08:07,273 --> 00:08:09,206
like she was dying.

95
00:08:09,206 --> 00:08:12,012
Why are you standing there like a statue now?

96
00:08:12,012 --> 00:08:13,288
Go to the ER.

97
00:08:13,288 --> 00:08:14,923
Get a CT, an MRI.

98
00:08:14,923 --> 00:08:16,291
Don't come crying later when it hurts.

99
00:08:16,291 --> 00:08:18,226
Don't make a big deal out of it.

100
00:08:18,226 --> 00:08:20,231
Stop holding up busy people.

101
00:08:20,231 --> 00:08:22,139
Thank you.

102
00:08:22,139 --> 00:08:24,331
- Thank you so much.
- Thank you.

103
00:08:25,567 --> 00:08:26,672
Hey.

104
00:08:26,672 --> 00:08:28,739
Why would you let
Secretary Jo get his hands on that?

105
00:08:28,739 --> 00:08:31,157
You really want Choiseong to go under?

106
00:08:31,157 --> 00:08:33,307
That's what I'm saying.

107
00:08:33,939 --> 00:08:39,147
For God's sake, just tell me what you're up to.

108
00:08:39,147 --> 00:08:40,622
We need to have a chat, you and me.

109
00:08:40,622 --> 00:08:41,649
You want to talk to me?

110
00:08:41,649 --> 00:08:43,217
I've got something important
to talk to you about.

111
00:08:43,217 --> 00:08:46,225
But I need answers from him.

112
00:08:46,225 --> 00:08:48,318
I should be in on this.

113
00:08:57,717 --> 00:08:59,286
Hey, Jun Hyeon.

114
00:09:01,736 --> 00:09:03,513
Should I march up to Jae Gyeong and tell her

115
00:09:03,513 --> 00:09:05,894
you're teaming up with Taeha to screw her over?

116
00:09:07,042 --> 00:09:08,545
Or maybe...

117
00:09:10,372 --> 00:09:12,280
I bring this to Chairman Na?

118
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:14,281
Where did you get that?

119
00:09:15,338 --> 00:09:16,445
I stole it.

120
00:09:16,445 --> 00:09:17,819
Right out of Chairman Na's house.

121
00:09:17,819 --> 00:09:20,121
That guy Na Byeong Mo is no joke.

122
00:09:20,121 --> 00:09:22,757
What were you thinking?

123
00:09:23,524 --> 00:09:24,625
<i>Open your eyes!</i>

124
00:09:24,625 --> 00:09:25,805
<i>Wake up. Bang Geul!</i>

125
00:09:25,805 --> 00:09:27,294
<i>Can't you hear Dad?</i>

126
00:09:29,395 --> 00:09:31,634
Why do you care so much?

127
00:09:31,634 --> 00:09:32,367
What?

128
00:09:32,367 --> 00:09:34,603
You're worried about me.

129
00:09:34,603 --> 00:09:37,137
Everything you've been doing
was to keep me safe.

130
00:09:39,207 --> 00:09:41,242
She's my sister. He was my dad.

131
00:09:41,242 --> 00:09:42,436
The revenge is mine to take.

132
00:09:42,436 --> 00:09:44,316
Who are you to be jumping in?

133
00:09:44,316 --> 00:09:46,015
Why are you telling me to stay out of it?

134
00:09:46,015 --> 00:09:47,182
Who do you think you are?

135
00:09:47,182 --> 00:09:48,449
Yes,

136
00:09:48,449 --> 00:09:52,687
I'm losing sleep over you,
over your mom getting dragged into this.

137
00:09:52,687 --> 00:09:54,338
I'm worried sick

138
00:09:54,338 --> 00:09:57,424
you'll play avenger
and get caught by those bastards.

139
00:09:59,106 --> 00:10:00,594
"Those bastards"?

140
00:10:02,230 --> 00:10:05,700
Chairman Na was involved in killing my dad?

141
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:08,770
Don't tell me he was Jae Gyeong's accomplice.

142
00:10:08,770 --> 00:10:10,304
Hwang Jun Hyeon!

143
00:10:13,338 --> 00:10:15,743
I've been digging
into the security guard's phone

144
00:10:15,743 --> 00:10:17,611
trying to recover the hospital CCTV.

145
00:10:19,376 --> 00:10:24,324
They framed Jae Gyeong to grab Choiseong.

146
00:10:25,709 --> 00:10:27,822
Na Eun Se's the one who killed him.

147
00:10:34,839 --> 00:10:36,330
You sure?

148
00:10:44,215 --> 00:10:45,759
So my dad...

149
00:10:46,741 --> 00:10:51,846
was just a pawn the whole time?

150
00:10:59,139 --> 00:11:01,455
I'm really grateful for everything you've done.

151
00:11:02,338 --> 00:11:03,991
But step back.

152
00:11:04,775 --> 00:11:06,560
This is my fight.

153
00:11:07,282 --> 00:11:08,763
They've killed people.

154
00:11:08,763 --> 00:11:11,342
You can't go after them by yourself!

155
00:11:11,342 --> 00:11:13,367
My heart just breaks for Dad.

156
00:11:14,232 --> 00:11:17,072
I need to show Dad he wasn't forgotten.

157
00:11:17,072 --> 00:11:21,743
I want him to know his life...

158
00:11:21,743 --> 00:11:23,510
wasn't some lonely ending.

159
00:11:37,839 --> 00:11:39,360
Don't...

160
00:11:41,739 --> 00:11:46,033
let this make you ugly, Bang Geul.

161
00:11:49,404 --> 00:11:54,675
Once your hands are dirty, once you turn cold,
revenge ends up...

162
00:11:56,705 --> 00:11:58,846
wrecking you.

163
00:12:00,572 --> 00:12:03,251
I don't want that for you.

164
00:12:03,251 --> 00:12:05,188
I'll handle the dirty work.

165
00:12:09,139 --> 00:12:11,792
I said this is my fight.

166
00:12:11,792 --> 00:12:15,029
- Why would you...
- Because your dad wouldn't want it.

167
00:12:18,442 --> 00:12:22,036
No dad in the world
wants his daughter to go down

168
00:12:24,972 --> 00:12:26,941
because of him.

169
00:12:39,906 --> 00:12:42,142
Come clean.

170
00:12:42,142 --> 00:12:44,585
You're hiding a daughter, aren't you?

171
00:12:47,973 --> 00:12:50,664
I'm letting you in.

172
00:12:52,705 --> 00:12:54,902
From now on, we do this together.

173
00:12:56,313 --> 00:12:57,705
Okay.

174
00:13:00,841 --> 00:13:04,011
[Chairman Na Byeong Mo]

175
00:13:04,011 --> 00:13:07,181
First, let's take down Secretary Jo.

176
00:13:20,055 --> 00:13:25,132
You want to... explain what happened today?

177
00:13:31,372 --> 00:13:33,875
Before that, you should get a new secretary.

178
00:13:33,875 --> 00:13:37,012
How long are you going
to keep this thug by your side?

179
00:13:37,012 --> 00:13:39,780
You're a chairman of a major conglomerate now.

180
00:13:40,863 --> 00:13:44,305
Thanks to him,
I look like I can't even finish off Bang Geul.

181
00:13:44,305 --> 00:13:45,786
But...

182
00:13:46,954 --> 00:13:50,158
He nearly ruined
the whole thing just to take credit.

183
00:13:50,158 --> 00:13:53,985
Plenty of smart guys out there.
Why waste time on this clown?

184
00:13:53,985 --> 00:13:55,096
Hwang Jun Hyeon.

185
00:13:55,096 --> 00:13:56,597
Enough.

186
00:13:58,745 --> 00:14:01,954
Get this to Taeha Energy.
Have them check the tech.

187
00:14:01,954 --> 00:14:04,206
Results will tell us.

188
00:14:04,206 --> 00:14:08,175
Brains or fists. We'll see which I need.

189
00:14:16,938 --> 00:14:19,018
What if Jae Gyeong starts asking questions?

190
00:14:19,018 --> 00:14:20,354
There was an incident.

191
00:14:20,354 --> 00:14:24,258
She's aware her sister's been making noise.
I'll blame her for it.

192
00:14:25,398 --> 00:14:27,378
She makes a decent shield.

193
00:14:27,378 --> 00:14:30,765
She lost the very tech she was about to sell.

194
00:14:30,765 --> 00:14:33,894
Her position is shaky.

195
00:14:40,305 --> 00:14:41,609
[Lee Sang Jae]
<i>Forensics complete.</i>

196
00:14:41,609 --> 00:14:44,678
<i>Original CCTV recovered.</i>

197
00:14:47,059 --> 00:14:49,349
This is going to be one to watch.

198
00:14:51,039 --> 00:14:53,053
Look forward to it, Chairman.

199
00:15:08,872 --> 00:15:11,638
What is she doing here this late?

200
00:15:14,476 --> 00:15:19,247
<i>They framed Jae Gyeong to grab Choiseong.</i>

201
00:15:19,247 --> 00:15:21,380
<i>Na Eun Se's the one who killed him.</i>

202
00:15:33,739 --> 00:15:35,362
Lost your mind?

203
00:15:35,362 --> 00:15:37,131
You asking for it?

204
00:15:45,806 --> 00:15:47,173
You okay?

205
00:15:47,173 --> 00:15:48,372
Have you lost your mind?

206
00:15:48,372 --> 00:15:49,778
She's the crazy one.

207
00:15:49,778 --> 00:15:51,178
Hey!

208
00:15:52,305 --> 00:15:53,915
What's with the look?

209
00:15:53,915 --> 00:15:55,807
Wishing you'd died?

210
00:15:55,807 --> 00:15:58,027
Take it up with Jae Gyeong.

211
00:15:58,027 --> 00:16:00,654
Don't come crying to me.

212
00:16:00,654 --> 00:16:02,556
You feel untouchable now?

213
00:16:04,493 --> 00:16:06,207
Like the world is yours?

214
00:16:06,207 --> 00:16:07,661
Bang Geul.

215
00:16:10,338 --> 00:16:12,567
I outrank you in this family.

216
00:16:12,567 --> 00:16:14,935
Watch your mouth.

217
00:16:17,005 --> 00:16:20,317
You want to see me push it? I'll show you.

218
00:16:20,317 --> 00:16:21,957
Stay tuned.

219
00:16:23,139 --> 00:16:24,645
Go ahead.

220
00:16:25,537 --> 00:16:28,315
Who are you to scare me?

221
00:16:30,819 --> 00:16:33,087
That's enough. Go inside.

222
00:16:33,087 --> 00:16:34,906
Get off me.

223
00:16:34,906 --> 00:16:36,772
Blood really is thicker than water, huh?

224
00:16:36,772 --> 00:16:39,139
Seriously...

225
00:16:39,139 --> 00:16:43,764
I'm done with the Kangs.

226
00:16:57,846 --> 00:17:00,514
Spitting image of her father. More and more.

227
00:17:00,514 --> 00:17:01,914
Right?

228
00:17:03,338 --> 00:17:06,080
Hey, did that shake you up?

229
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:08,190
Your head's hurt, right? Is that what it is?

230
00:17:08,190 --> 00:17:10,958
- Forget it, let's get you to a hospital.
- Jae Seong.

231
00:17:18,664 --> 00:17:23,870
It was Na Eun Se... Taeha was behind it...

232
00:17:48,096 --> 00:17:50,305
<i>Don't trust that girl.</i>

233
00:17:50,305 --> 00:17:55,936
<i>Chairman Na never makes a losing trade,
so why hand her to someone like you?</i>

234
00:17:55,936 --> 00:18:00,641
<i>Come on, I said don't worry about Eun Se.</i>

235
00:18:03,839 --> 00:18:05,646
Stupid bastard.

236
00:18:06,739 --> 00:18:08,682
Moron.

237
00:18:12,139 --> 00:18:14,087
This is all your fault.

238
00:18:17,272 --> 00:18:21,094
None of this would've happened without you.

239
00:18:23,173 --> 00:18:25,432
You did this.

240
00:18:44,139 --> 00:18:45,719
Mom!

241
00:18:45,719 --> 00:18:48,618
Let go! I'm bringing him home right now.

242
00:18:48,618 --> 00:18:50,891
Mom, just calm down first.

243
00:18:50,891 --> 00:18:54,194
Can you imagine what he's going through?

244
00:18:54,958 --> 00:18:59,300
What kind of life will Yi Jun have
under that woman?

245
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:00,902
Are they even human?

246
00:19:00,902 --> 00:19:05,231
How could they do this to your dad?

247
00:19:05,231 --> 00:19:06,958
I know, Mom.

248
00:19:06,958 --> 00:19:13,239
I want to kill them right now,
but I'm holding back for Dad.

249
00:19:13,239 --> 00:19:16,505
I'm going to make
those scumbags tear each other apart.

250
00:19:16,505 --> 00:19:18,352
We are not sinking to their level.

251
00:19:19,705 --> 00:19:21,806
Mom.

252
00:19:21,806 --> 00:19:23,657
How could they...

253
00:19:32,072 --> 00:19:34,301
We're all set, Chairman.

254
00:19:37,844 --> 00:19:41,372
I told you to lay low
until you take over as president of Trading.

255
00:19:41,372 --> 00:19:44,613
I have to file for divorce anyway
because of Yi Jun.

256
00:19:44,613 --> 00:19:48,450
Since it's happening,
I refuse to spend another day in that house.

257
00:19:48,450 --> 00:19:50,371
It's not a good look.

258
00:19:50,371 --> 00:19:52,863
Why does that matter?

259
00:19:52,863 --> 00:19:55,288
We have Jae Gyeong right where we want her.

260
00:19:59,393 --> 00:20:00,787
[Managing Director Kwon]

261
00:20:01,472 --> 00:20:03,096
Yes, MD Kwon.

262
00:20:06,939 --> 00:20:09,202
Wait, what are you talking about?

263
00:20:11,405 --> 00:20:13,076
[Chairman Kang Jae Gyeong]

264
00:20:15,206 --> 00:20:16,877
You're firing me?

265
00:20:17,572 --> 00:20:18,875
On whose authority?

266
00:20:18,875 --> 00:20:22,355
Hiring and firing is a perk
of being the chairman.

267
00:20:22,355 --> 00:20:26,587
You think your position is safe
if you kick me out?

268
00:20:26,587 --> 00:20:28,355
I'm shaking.

269
00:20:29,055 --> 00:20:32,592
Are you really going to take me down?

270
00:20:37,372 --> 00:20:39,132
You're going to regret this.

271
00:20:50,767 --> 00:20:52,687
Aren't you pushing her a little too hard?

272
00:20:52,687 --> 00:20:55,350
She needs to be provoked to show her hand.

273
00:20:55,350 --> 00:20:57,615
I made that call because I trust you.

274
00:21:00,020 --> 00:21:02,006
You said you found
the hospital security footage.

275
00:21:02,006 --> 00:21:06,226
I searched the dead security guard's house
and found his phone.

276
00:21:09,372 --> 00:21:11,431
Here's the recovered footage.

277
00:21:16,472 --> 00:21:20,275
I wonder just how far Eun Se is willing to go.

278
00:21:20,275 --> 00:21:22,705
Are you just going to let her
get away with this?

279
00:21:22,705 --> 00:21:24,372
Let's leak the security footage
and the recording

280
00:21:24,372 --> 00:21:26,046
and destroy Choiseong, Dad.

281
00:21:26,046 --> 00:21:28,968
<i>Don't do anything rash and just wait.</i>

282
00:21:28,968 --> 00:21:31,251
How much longer!

283
00:21:39,526 --> 00:21:40,918
[CEO Jeong Hak Hui, Hayoung Daily]

284
00:21:45,106 --> 00:21:49,771
CEO Jeong, go ahead and publish that tip.

285
00:21:49,771 --> 00:21:52,039
[Late Chairman Kang's Death: Footage Leaked]

286
00:21:52,039 --> 00:21:53,140
[Shocking Footage of Chairman Kang's Death]

287
00:21:53,140 --> 00:21:54,705
[The Truth Behind Chairman Kang's Death]

288
00:21:54,705 --> 00:21:57,639
<i>At first,
she tried to inject the sleeping pills</i>

289
00:21:57,639 --> 00:22:00,620
<i>she got from her husband
so Dad wouldn't wake up.</i>

290
00:22:00,620 --> 00:22:06,220
<i>But when he suddenly opened his eyes,
she just smothered him with a pillow.</i>

291
00:22:06,220 --> 00:22:08,456
<i>Your husband is an accomplice, too.</i>

292
00:22:08,456 --> 00:22:11,024
<i>Do you really want to argue
over whose crime is worse?</i>

293
00:22:11,024 --> 00:22:12,126
[If he's an accomplice, they did it together]

294
00:22:12,126 --> 00:22:14,094
[Life in prison is too good for them]

295
00:22:14,094 --> 00:22:15,262
[Views]

296
00:22:15,262 --> 00:22:16,630
[The released transcript may be
the only key evidence revealing the crime]

297
00:22:16,630 --> 00:22:22,573
[Suspicious Death: Who Was the Last Visitor?]

298
00:22:23,939 --> 00:22:27,240
I told her to wait,
but she still went and pulled this stunt?

299
00:22:33,438 --> 00:22:34,639
Chairman,

300
00:22:34,639 --> 00:22:38,043
there's an issue with the hydrogen tech files
we took from Choiseong.

301
00:22:38,043 --> 00:22:39,586
We checked them several times,

302
00:22:39,586 --> 00:22:42,856
but they're an older version
than what we already had.

303
00:22:46,438 --> 00:22:48,628
<i>This is going to be one to watch.</i>

304
00:22:49,404 --> 00:22:51,591
<i>Look forward to it, Chairman.</i>

305
00:22:51,591 --> 00:22:54,200
Hwang Jun Hyeon, that bastard.

306
00:23:06,438 --> 00:23:10,919
[Choiseong Press Briefing]
I deeply apologize for the shock

307
00:23:10,919 --> 00:23:14,067
and disappointment many of you must have felt.

308
00:23:15,909 --> 00:23:18,305
After much agonizing,

309
00:23:18,305 --> 00:23:21,494
I am standing here today because I decided

310
00:23:22,996 --> 00:23:25,165
I can no longer hide the truth.

311
00:23:26,635 --> 00:23:31,071
The truth is, I am being blackmailed

312
00:23:33,809 --> 00:23:36,543
over my father's death.

313
00:23:38,672 --> 00:23:40,980
Is it true you visited
his hospital room that day?

314
00:23:40,980 --> 00:23:43,116
Are you also denying
the contents of the recording?

315
00:23:43,116 --> 00:23:46,139
We suspect the person
demanding a huge sum of money

316
00:23:46,139 --> 00:23:48,922
with the fabricated recording and footage

317
00:23:48,922 --> 00:23:53,572
is the same individual

318
00:23:53,572 --> 00:23:57,364
who broke
into the Daesan Hydrogen Complex recently

319
00:23:58,163 --> 00:24:00,604
and leaked our core hydrogen tech.

320
00:24:00,604 --> 00:24:02,564
Have you identified a suspect?

321
00:24:02,564 --> 00:24:06,640
We handed their identity over to the police
along with the security footage as evidence.

322
00:24:06,640 --> 00:24:09,209
We also believe
the real culprit who killed my father

323
00:24:09,209 --> 00:24:11,224
is part of the same group.

324
00:24:11,224 --> 00:24:14,681
Are you saying
the late Chairman Kang Yong Ho was murdered?

325
00:24:17,906 --> 00:24:20,887
We've secured evidence
pointing to the real culprit.

326
00:24:28,161 --> 00:24:29,275
[Choiseong Press Briefing]

327
00:24:30,072 --> 00:24:32,006
What is that?

328
00:24:32,006 --> 00:24:33,867
Isn't that Chairman Kang?

329
00:24:44,039 --> 00:24:48,705
Did the culprit dress up as you
to kill your father?

330
00:24:48,705 --> 00:24:49,894
Do you also have the original footage?

331
00:24:49,894 --> 00:24:51,692
You used the word "group."

332
00:24:51,692 --> 00:24:53,305
Are you saying they didn't act alone?

333
00:24:53,305 --> 00:24:54,705
Can you identify them?

334
00:24:54,705 --> 00:24:56,139
Is it someone from inside Choiseong?

335
00:24:56,139 --> 00:24:58,239
Why are you just now releasing the footage?

336
00:24:58,239 --> 00:24:59,793
I ask that...

337
00:25:03,605 --> 00:25:06,099
you stop exploiting...

338
00:25:06,972 --> 00:25:09,672
my father's death...

339
00:25:09,672 --> 00:25:15,308
so he can... finally rest in peace.

340
00:25:24,338 --> 00:25:27,087
Her acting is seriously giving me the creeps.

341
00:25:33,929 --> 00:25:38,631
She's just using my dad
right up to the very end.

342
00:25:50,505 --> 00:25:52,179
Public opinion has completely flipped.

343
00:25:52,179 --> 00:25:54,516
There are wild guesses flying around
about the real culprit.

344
00:25:54,516 --> 00:25:58,051
Since your daughter is also implicated
in the recording,

345
00:25:58,051 --> 00:26:01,087
the focus might shift to Taeha
if we're not careful.

346
00:26:02,806 --> 00:26:04,524
What do we do, Dad?

347
00:26:04,524 --> 00:26:08,661
When you swing a sword recklessly,
you're bound to cut yourself.

348
00:26:10,472 --> 00:26:13,133
How does Jae Gyeong have the original footage?

349
00:26:13,133 --> 00:26:14,857
You said you took care of everything.

350
00:26:14,857 --> 00:26:17,239
You blaming your own father now?

351
00:26:17,239 --> 00:26:21,239
You forced me in there
because you got sick of waiting around

352
00:26:21,239 --> 00:26:23,610
for somebody else to bring you Choiseong.

353
00:26:24,456 --> 00:26:26,556
You wanted me to be the one to finish him off.

354
00:26:26,556 --> 00:26:27,582
So?

355
00:26:27,582 --> 00:26:32,452
Nobody was happier than you
when Chairman Kang died,

356
00:26:35,802 --> 00:26:40,360
so I don't deserve any of this.

357
00:26:42,206 --> 00:26:44,639
- Hey, stop them!
- Who are you people?

358
00:26:44,639 --> 00:26:46,266
Who are you people?

359
00:26:46,266 --> 00:26:47,323
Jo Taek Sang,

360
00:26:47,323 --> 00:26:49,872
you're under arrest for trespassing
and industrial espionage.

361
00:26:49,872 --> 00:26:51,383
You have the right to an attorney.

362
00:26:51,383 --> 00:26:55,505
You have the right to remain silent,
and anything you say can be used against you.

363
00:26:55,505 --> 00:26:59,739
Heads up.
You, your chairman, and the executives

364
00:26:59,739 --> 00:27:02,749
could all be brought in over that stolen tech.

365
00:27:06,939 --> 00:27:08,988
Dad.

366
00:27:12,893 --> 00:27:15,700
[Kang Jae Gyeong]

367
00:27:33,978 --> 00:27:35,515
This way.

368
00:27:40,072 --> 00:27:41,888
Brains always win, don't they?

369
00:27:42,739 --> 00:27:45,560
Looks like you need a new secretary.

370
00:27:45,560 --> 00:27:48,995
Good luck finding talent like mine.

371
00:27:49,631 --> 00:27:52,866
Remember that security guard you killed?

372
00:27:52,866 --> 00:27:55,303
Mr. Hwang found his phone.

373
00:27:55,303 --> 00:27:57,572
Found some pretty interesting stuff on it.

374
00:27:57,572 --> 00:28:01,040
Should've killed that bastard too.

375
00:28:04,064 --> 00:28:07,561
Thanks to you, I had the best laugh in ages.

376
00:28:08,239 --> 00:28:10,452
Really something, aren't you?

377
00:28:10,452 --> 00:28:14,488
You made your daughter do the killing.

378
00:28:14,488 --> 00:28:17,557
I'm actually starting to feel bad for her.

379
00:28:18,539 --> 00:28:22,939
By the way, once people find out...

380
00:28:22,939 --> 00:28:28,949
you murdered your in-law for Choiseong,
Taeha's done, right?

381
00:28:32,077 --> 00:28:34,307
I've got a soft heart.

382
00:28:35,476 --> 00:28:38,246
Hand over Taeha Energy.

383
00:28:38,246 --> 00:28:40,816
You nearly framed me
as the beast who murdered Dad.

384
00:28:40,816 --> 00:28:44,572
That much is the bare minimum
if you want my help.

385
00:28:44,572 --> 00:28:45,872
And...

386
00:28:45,872 --> 00:28:49,055
The money for the buyout?

387
00:28:49,055 --> 00:28:51,424
That's on you, right?

388
00:28:53,972 --> 00:28:58,698
You've got a stash tucked away in Singapore.

389
00:29:16,527 --> 00:29:20,139
Mr. Hwang dug that up too.

390
00:29:20,139 --> 00:29:22,522
He scares even me sometimes.

391
00:29:26,106 --> 00:29:28,161
A lot to think about, isn't it?

392
00:29:29,129 --> 00:29:32,966
Cutting your daughter loose
won't make this go away.

393
00:29:32,966 --> 00:29:35,268
- Watch your mouth.
- Keep your voice down.

394
00:29:35,268 --> 00:29:36,836
Dad.

395
00:29:44,006 --> 00:29:49,956
I'll think about it
if you bury Kang Yong Ho's death for good.

396
00:29:52,095 --> 00:29:54,787
The living have to keep living.

397
00:29:55,929 --> 00:30:01,917
I'm not cruel enough
to cut off your people's livelihood.

398
00:30:16,872 --> 00:30:20,246
How did you find out about this?

399
00:30:20,246 --> 00:30:24,986
You asked Chairman Kang
about overseas tax havens before, didn't you?

400
00:30:24,986 --> 00:30:27,721
Even though he called you pathetic

401
00:30:27,721 --> 00:30:31,992
for cheaply copying
everything a chaebol chairman does.

402
00:30:31,992 --> 00:30:33,993
How do you know that?

403
00:30:33,993 --> 00:30:38,131
Since you were family,
he couldn't just ignore you.

404
00:30:39,701 --> 00:30:43,236
He showed you how,
but kept copies of all the documents.

405
00:30:43,236 --> 00:30:45,171
[Taeha Group Chairman Na Byeong Mo's
Slush Fund Records]

406
00:30:45,171 --> 00:30:47,540
Of course, even Chairman Kang never thought

407
00:30:47,540 --> 00:30:50,243
this card would be used
in a situation like this.

408
00:30:50,243 --> 00:30:52,278
Chairman Kang told you?

409
00:30:52,278 --> 00:30:53,378
Why?

410
00:30:53,378 --> 00:30:54,865
Who exactly are you?

411
00:30:54,865 --> 00:30:56,282
Good question.

412
00:30:57,772 --> 00:30:59,819
Who do you think I am?

413
00:31:01,990 --> 00:31:06,793
Please get ready
for Singapore as soon as possible.

414
00:31:15,101 --> 00:31:18,605
[Chairman Kang Jae Gyeong]

415
00:31:22,246 --> 00:31:27,180
Thanks to you,
I kept my seat and got Taeha Energy.

416
00:31:28,181 --> 00:31:32,621
I pulled off what my father couldn't.

417
00:31:32,621 --> 00:31:35,703
What would I ever do without you?

418
00:31:38,539 --> 00:31:42,795
<i>Should we just swallow Taeha whole?</i>

419
00:31:43,999 --> 00:31:45,965
Not on my watch.

420
00:31:52,300 --> 00:31:54,239
Where have you been this late?

421
00:31:54,239 --> 00:31:57,879
Just... went for a walk.

422
00:31:57,879 --> 00:31:59,780
It's dangerous out there...

423
00:32:04,724 --> 00:32:06,805
It'll be over soon.

424
00:32:07,892 --> 00:32:10,356
Kang Jae Gyeong and Taeha.

425
00:32:13,259 --> 00:32:14,659
Well...

426
00:32:15,605 --> 00:32:17,539
About Seok Do...

427
00:32:17,539 --> 00:32:18,931
What?

428
00:32:21,989 --> 00:32:23,669
Never mind.

429
00:32:24,639 --> 00:32:26,873
You're going on a business trip tomorrow?

430
00:32:42,218 --> 00:32:44,006
You came alone?

431
00:32:44,006 --> 00:32:45,358
You've got some nerve.

432
00:32:45,358 --> 00:32:49,762
She said she won't let it slide
if I get a single scratch.

433
00:32:51,739 --> 00:32:54,800
Do whatever you want
if you want to make the 9 o'clock news.

434
00:32:56,139 --> 00:32:57,470
Oh, I'm terrified.

435
00:32:57,470 --> 00:32:58,673
Economy?

436
00:32:58,673 --> 00:33:01,585
You should spend a little money
for an important trip like this.

437
00:33:01,585 --> 00:33:02,944
I'm in first class.

438
00:33:02,944 --> 00:33:04,369
First.

439
00:33:06,579 --> 00:33:08,447
That little...

440
00:33:12,539 --> 00:33:15,525
Yes, Chairman, I'm boarding now.

441
00:33:15,525 --> 00:33:18,045
Did you get the money launderers?

442
00:33:18,045 --> 00:33:20,426
<i>The guys who helped you set up Siren.</i>

443
00:33:20,426 --> 00:33:23,162
I arranged for you to meet them in Singapore.

444
00:33:24,488 --> 00:33:25,705
What about the shell company

445
00:33:25,705 --> 00:33:28,209
to use as a cushion
for Na Byeong Mo's money laundering?

446
00:33:28,209 --> 00:33:31,137
I have an expert for that, so don't worry.

447
00:33:31,137 --> 00:33:32,707
<i>I'm not worried.</i>

448
00:33:32,707 --> 00:33:34,306
<i>Keep up the good work.</i>

449
00:33:36,372 --> 00:33:38,110
Careful there.

450
00:33:39,872 --> 00:33:41,380
Thank you.

451
00:33:46,839 --> 00:33:50,690
Why is she dressed like that again?

452
00:33:53,472 --> 00:33:55,494
Everyone's staring.

453
00:33:56,896 --> 00:33:58,559
[Taeha Energy Business and Operations Analysis]

454
00:34:06,639 --> 00:34:10,453
Let's wrap up the Taeha Energy M&amp;A plan
before Team Leader Hwang gets back.

455
00:34:10,453 --> 00:34:12,311
- Yes, Chairman.
- Yes, Chairman.

456
00:34:14,013 --> 00:34:15,414
What about my husband?

457
00:34:16,438 --> 00:34:18,384
What's he been up to lately?

458
00:34:36,037 --> 00:34:41,307
You always blew me off saying you were busy,
but you're sure playing a lot of golf.

459
00:34:42,639 --> 00:34:46,045
I haven't played in a while,
so my body feels stiff.

460
00:34:46,779 --> 00:34:48,650
Plus, you've been busy.

461
00:34:50,572 --> 00:34:52,921
You've changed a bit.

462
00:34:52,921 --> 00:34:54,725
Your whole vibe, too.

463
00:34:55,939 --> 00:34:58,008
We went through a lot.

464
00:34:58,008 --> 00:35:00,159
Anyone would change after that.

465
00:35:10,872 --> 00:35:15,007
Do you like... the new car?

466
00:35:37,664 --> 00:35:39,865
[Therapeutic Strategies
for Recovery in Hypoxic Brain Injury]

467
00:35:51,841 --> 00:35:55,347
Are you doing volunteer work... out of guilt?

468
00:35:55,347 --> 00:35:56,972
Or...

469
00:35:56,972 --> 00:35:59,552
are you trying to resurrect my cremated father?

470
00:36:14,438 --> 00:36:17,206
What would people say
if a guy who only saw patients

471
00:36:17,206 --> 00:36:19,174
suddenly jumped into corporate work?

472
00:36:19,174 --> 00:36:21,903
You want them calling me your nepotism hire?

473
00:36:21,903 --> 00:36:24,628
I don't want to be your puppet
in Chemicals or Trading.

474
00:36:24,628 --> 00:36:28,022
I'm thinking of starting
a medical business division for neurology.

475
00:36:28,022 --> 00:36:31,851
Treating your father
got me interested in coma cases.

476
00:36:36,622 --> 00:36:41,360
You quit the hospital,
yet you took syringes and coma meds with you.

477
00:36:42,382 --> 00:36:47,083
I just thought...
you were up to something shady.

478
00:36:47,083 --> 00:36:48,567
Jae Gyeong.

479
00:36:50,245 --> 00:36:51,771
Are you scared?

480
00:36:52,553 --> 00:36:54,807
Scared that I'll leave you, too?

481
00:36:56,605 --> 00:36:58,513
Leave?

482
00:36:58,513 --> 00:37:00,653
I was the one who threw them away.

483
00:37:00,653 --> 00:37:05,372
I ended that toxic relationship
they called family.

484
00:37:05,372 --> 00:37:08,254
I only need you and Il Jun.

485
00:37:11,693 --> 00:37:15,594
I'll tell them to push forward
with the medical division.

486
00:37:17,273 --> 00:37:19,398
I'm the chairman of Choiseong.

487
00:37:20,148 --> 00:37:22,435
You have nothing to be ashamed of.

488
00:37:31,273 --> 00:37:33,913
- To the office.
- Yes, ma'am.

489
00:37:34,647 --> 00:37:36,848
I have a lot of TF team work.

490
00:37:36,848 --> 00:37:38,538
You're heading home, right?

491
00:38:18,860 --> 00:38:22,561
Sir, you absolutely cannot lose that car.

492
00:38:51,840 --> 00:38:53,492
Mrs. Jo.

493
00:38:58,900 --> 00:39:01,467
Hold on! Please listen to me first!

494
00:39:05,106 --> 00:39:06,639
Wait!

495
00:39:14,372 --> 00:39:16,515
How did you find this place?

496
00:39:40,142 --> 00:39:46,069
You've been doing this... behind my back?

497
00:39:46,879 --> 00:39:48,617
I'm sorry.

498
00:39:48,617 --> 00:39:50,505
I was terrified...

499
00:39:50,505 --> 00:39:54,856
he might take a turn for the worse
and hurt you even more.

500
00:39:54,856 --> 00:39:59,959
I was just too scared... to tell you.

501
00:39:59,959 --> 00:40:01,860
I have no excuses.

502
00:40:08,737 --> 00:40:10,869
Thank you, Jae Seong.

503
00:40:14,405 --> 00:40:18,410
Thank you... for saving him.

504
00:40:20,784 --> 00:40:23,894
Thank you for letting me see him again.

505
00:40:27,956 --> 00:40:30,525
I'm so grateful.

506
00:40:30,525 --> 00:40:32,130
I'll make sure...

507
00:40:32,739 --> 00:40:37,363
he wakes up, Mother.

508
00:40:46,439 --> 00:40:49,698
Is he really handing that slush fund
over to Kang Jae Gyeong?

509
00:40:49,698 --> 00:40:51,410
Not a chance.

510
00:40:52,297 --> 00:40:54,583
This is Na Byeong Mo's slush fund file.

511
00:40:54,583 --> 00:40:58,854
It has everything
from his Singapore accounts to his proxies.

512
00:40:58,854 --> 00:41:02,772
Jun Hyeon left it for us
to hand over to the police.

513
00:41:02,772 --> 00:41:06,772
Then why did they take Na Eun Se
all the way to Singapore?

514
00:41:06,772 --> 00:41:09,064
Bang Geul said it herself.

515
00:41:09,064 --> 00:41:10,896
"Manager,

516
00:41:10,896 --> 00:41:13,006
how solid do you think
a father-daughter bond is

517
00:41:13,006 --> 00:41:15,043
when they've committed murder?"

518
00:41:15,043 --> 00:41:18,306
Na Byeong Mo won't even consider
saving his daughter.

519
00:41:18,306 --> 00:41:20,584
He's only worried about the group taking a hit.

520
00:41:20,584 --> 00:41:22,110
Bingo.

521
00:41:22,110 --> 00:41:23,976
She said that's what they're counting on.

522
00:41:23,976 --> 00:41:26,763
What are you two doing? Come on out.

523
00:41:26,763 --> 00:41:29,117
- Coming.
- Yes, ma'am.

524
00:41:29,117 --> 00:41:30,552
Right.

525
00:41:34,673 --> 00:41:37,657
We'll keep you safe
until your grandson gets back.

526
00:41:37,657 --> 00:41:40,061
Just think of us as your two new sons.

527
00:41:40,061 --> 00:41:41,661
Makes you feel safe, right?

528
00:41:42,364 --> 00:41:43,863
I cooked up some chicken.

529
00:41:43,863 --> 00:41:45,233
Have a seat.

530
00:41:45,233 --> 00:41:47,191
Oh, really?

531
00:41:47,191 --> 00:41:48,200
Oh...

532
00:41:48,200 --> 00:41:52,004
I was actually just thinking
something smelled amazing.

533
00:41:52,814 --> 00:41:55,441
We're the ones
supposed to be taking care of you.

534
00:41:55,441 --> 00:41:58,811
I heard you help Jun Hyeon out a lot.

535
00:41:58,811 --> 00:42:01,881
The girl next door told me
you're his best friends.

536
00:42:01,881 --> 00:42:03,182
- Yes, ma'am.
- Yes, ma'am.

537
00:42:03,182 --> 00:42:04,283
You boys drink, right?

538
00:42:04,283 --> 00:42:07,035
- Thank you for the drinks.
- Stay seated.

539
00:42:07,035 --> 00:42:09,494
- I'll whip this up quickly.
- Sounds good.

540
00:42:09,494 --> 00:42:13,225
- It'll be right out.
- Looks like we're the ones being treated here.

541
00:42:15,394 --> 00:42:16,444
Are you crying again?

542
00:42:16,444 --> 00:42:18,680
Must be male menopause.

543
00:42:19,438 --> 00:42:22,278
Just wait till Jun Hyeon gets back.

544
00:42:22,278 --> 00:42:23,936
I'm going to treat him so well.

545
00:42:23,936 --> 00:42:25,571
Come on.

546
00:42:26,539 --> 00:42:28,310
Have a seat.

547
00:42:28,310 --> 00:42:32,678
[Singapore]

548
00:42:32,678 --> 00:42:36,051
Write Chairman Na's Singapore account here.

549
00:42:36,051 --> 00:42:39,251
Take seven percent.
Send the rest to this foundation account.

550
00:42:44,806 --> 00:42:46,939
A seven percent fee?

551
00:42:46,939 --> 00:42:49,006
So after taking a 35 billion won cut,

552
00:42:49,006 --> 00:42:53,465
Jae Gyeong is just pocketing
over 450 billion won.

553
00:42:55,772 --> 00:42:57,569
Just sign it.

554
00:42:58,671 --> 00:42:59,742
[JH Soccer Club]

555
00:42:59,742 --> 00:43:01,705
JH?

556
00:43:01,705 --> 00:43:03,942
As in Hwang Jun Hyeon's JH?

557
00:43:05,405 --> 00:43:09,119
You slapped this together for laundering,
then you'll shut it down. Right?

558
00:43:09,119 --> 00:43:12,006
An expert put a lot of thought into this.

559
00:43:12,006 --> 00:43:13,288
Who knows?

560
00:43:13,288 --> 00:43:15,388
It might actually become
a prestigious soccer foundation.

561
00:43:15,388 --> 00:43:17,931
Order some champagne.

562
00:43:17,931 --> 00:43:20,295
We have way too much time before our flight.

563
00:43:20,295 --> 00:43:22,377
Let me walk you out.

564
00:43:23,206 --> 00:43:25,230
Excuse me.

565
00:43:29,505 --> 00:43:34,039
You guys...
need to earn your plane tickets, right?

566
00:43:41,817 --> 00:43:43,694
[Kang Bang Geul]
<i>Let's begin.</i>

567
00:43:47,586 --> 00:43:48,695
[CEO Jeong, Hayoung Daily]

568
00:43:53,139 --> 00:43:55,636
It's me, Kang Jae Seong.

569
00:44:15,650 --> 00:44:18,372
Are you sure about this? Doing this to me?

570
00:44:18,372 --> 00:44:20,995
Stop acting up
just because you trust Jae Gyeong.

571
00:44:20,995 --> 00:44:23,722
Guys like you are disposable
and a dime a dozen.

572
00:44:24,495 --> 00:44:26,692
Who says I trust Kang Jae Gyeong?

573
00:44:37,239 --> 00:44:39,908
The Daesan Hydrogen Complex
wasn't a coincidence, was it?

574
00:44:39,908 --> 00:44:44,410
You were just pretending to be on her side
while working with Bang Geul this whole time?

575
00:44:44,410 --> 00:44:46,745
Did you play all of us?

576
00:44:50,794 --> 00:44:53,619
Makes things easier that you catch on so fast.

577
00:44:56,739 --> 00:44:58,800
He probably won't answer.

578
00:44:58,800 --> 00:45:01,260
Chairman Na is going through hell right now.

579
00:45:02,772 --> 00:45:05,164
<i>Breaking news. The suspected murderer</i>

580
00:45:05,164 --> 00:45:07,199
[Hospital CCTV Footage]
<i>of the late Chairman Kang of Choiseong Group</i>

581
00:45:07,199 --> 00:45:09,247
<i>is believed to be his daughter-in-law, Ms. Na,</i>

582
00:45:09,247 --> 00:45:11,026
<i>sending shockwaves through the public.</i>

583
00:45:11,026 --> 00:45:14,217
<i>With clear footage of her face now released,</i>

584
00:45:14,217 --> 00:45:17,142
<i>the fallout
surrounding the late Chairman Kang's death</i>

585
00:45:17,142 --> 00:45:20,179
<i>is expected to grow.</i>

586
00:45:20,179 --> 00:45:23,382
If you don't want to get arrested
like Secretary Jo,

587
00:45:23,382 --> 00:45:25,751
it's every man for himself from now on.

588
00:45:31,939 --> 00:45:34,126
Then did you guys take the slush fund, too?

589
00:45:35,872 --> 00:45:37,963
Is this why you brought me here
in the first place?

590
00:45:37,963 --> 00:45:39,832
To trap me in a foreign country?

591
00:45:39,832 --> 00:45:41,833
Hwang Jun Hyeon, you bastard!

592
00:45:44,002 --> 00:45:46,038
Instead of playing the victim,

593
00:45:46,038 --> 00:45:48,039
you should be on your knees
begging Bang Geul for forgiveness,

594
00:45:48,039 --> 00:45:51,076
admitting you're a monster
who committed a deadly sin.

595
00:45:52,711 --> 00:45:57,528
Do you even realize what you've done
just to catch the killer of a dead old man?

596
00:46:01,539 --> 00:46:04,056
You think my dad
will let you get away with this?

597
00:46:06,639 --> 00:46:09,127
You still trust your dad, huh?

598
00:46:10,057 --> 00:46:14,366
Will Chairman Na save you,
or will he save Taeha?

599
00:46:18,874 --> 00:46:20,040
[CEO Jeon Jin Hwan, Taeha Energy]

600
00:46:23,042 --> 00:46:24,907
[CEO Shin Yong Ha, Taeha Chemicals]

601
00:46:27,079 --> 00:46:28,540
[Eldest Son, Taeha Construction]

602
00:46:33,485 --> 00:46:35,087
[International Call]

603
00:46:39,239 --> 00:46:40,517
<i>Dad.</i>

604
00:46:40,517 --> 00:46:43,562
Eun Se, are you okay?

605
00:46:43,562 --> 00:46:45,798
[Suspect Believed
to Be Daughter-in-Law, Ms. Na]

606
00:46:46,572 --> 00:46:50,602
There's no way Mr. Hwang leaked the video
without consulting me first.

607
00:46:51,739 --> 00:46:54,039
What on earth is going on?

608
00:46:56,405 --> 00:46:57,876
Chairman.

609
00:47:23,602 --> 00:47:25,540
[Choiseong: The Future of New Business]

610
00:47:26,372 --> 00:47:29,007
That despicable monster!

611
00:47:31,006 --> 00:47:34,177
Eun Se is no longer a daughter of mine.

612
00:47:34,177 --> 00:47:37,016
I'll drag her in myself,
expose her crimes to the world,

613
00:47:37,016 --> 00:47:39,551
and make sure she gets what she deserves.

614
00:47:40,355 --> 00:47:43,058
You must have been through so much.

615
00:47:43,058 --> 00:47:46,061
Your father and I were old friends
before we became in-laws.

616
00:47:46,061 --> 00:47:49,130
I don't even know how to ask
the deceased for forgiveness.

617
00:47:49,130 --> 00:47:51,230
If failing to keep a married daughter in line

618
00:47:51,230 --> 00:47:53,332
and being blind to all this
until it got to this point

619
00:47:53,332 --> 00:47:54,503
is a sin, then I am a sinner.

620
00:47:54,503 --> 00:47:58,637
Let me apologize... in her place.

621
00:48:10,173 --> 00:48:12,420
There are too many eyes here.

622
00:48:12,420 --> 00:48:14,753
Let's take this somewhere private.

623
00:48:16,890 --> 00:48:18,690
Chairman Na Byeong Mo.

624
00:48:20,195 --> 00:48:24,130
Your daughter, Na Eun Se,
left for Singapore yesterday, didn't she?

625
00:48:24,130 --> 00:48:26,072
I have no intention
of covering up my daughter's crimes,

626
00:48:26,072 --> 00:48:28,330
and I'll cooperate fully.

627
00:48:28,330 --> 00:48:29,691
As soon as she's back in Korea...

628
00:48:29,691 --> 00:48:33,875
Didn't you help her flee the country
to launder your slush fund?

629
00:48:33,875 --> 00:48:35,265
What?

630
00:48:37,109 --> 00:48:38,477
[Police for the People]
<i>Excuse me,</i>

631
00:48:38,477 --> 00:48:41,349
<i>where is the Anti-Corruption
and Economic Crime Investigation Unit?</i>

632
00:48:41,349 --> 00:48:43,174
<i>Just head this way.</i>

633
00:48:48,420 --> 00:48:50,934
[Taeha Group Chairman Na Byeong Mo's
Slush Fund Records]

634
00:48:51,793 --> 00:48:54,059
<i>Hot delivery coming through!</i>

635
00:48:54,059 --> 00:48:55,972
[Anti-Corruption
and Economic Crime Investigation Unit]

636
00:48:55,972 --> 00:48:57,505
Do you have any idea

637
00:48:57,505 --> 00:49:00,354
how many people try to drag me down
with false tips like that?

638
00:49:00,354 --> 00:49:03,414
Then you must know Ham Du Ho, right?

639
00:49:03,414 --> 00:49:05,207
He worked security
at Hangang University Hospital,

640
00:49:05,207 --> 00:49:07,208
and he died recently.

641
00:49:09,141 --> 00:49:10,755
Murdered, to be exact.

642
00:49:10,755 --> 00:49:14,550
And we have evidence
suggesting you ordered the hit.

643
00:49:14,550 --> 00:49:15,681
What a load of nonsense!

644
00:49:15,681 --> 00:49:18,450
<i>He contacted you too, right?</i>

645
00:49:19,141 --> 00:49:21,954
<i>There's another video
on the security guard's phone?</i>

646
00:49:21,954 --> 00:49:25,160
<i>Said he'd tell you the truth
if you paid enough.</i>

647
00:49:25,160 --> 00:49:28,161
<i>He got too greedy.</i>

648
00:49:28,161 --> 00:49:29,861
<i>Don't you think?</i>

649
00:49:30,866 --> 00:49:33,681
<i>Turns out he had
a hidden camera in his glasses.</i>

650
00:49:33,681 --> 00:49:37,539
<i>It recorded everything,
including Secretary Jo bribing him</i>

651
00:49:37,539 --> 00:49:39,106
<i>to steal the hospital CCTV footage.</i>

652
00:49:39,106 --> 00:49:43,712
<i>Let's show the world
who Na Byeong Mo really is,</i>

653
00:49:43,712 --> 00:49:45,377
<i>Sang Jae.</i>

654
00:49:46,739 --> 00:49:49,229
That's not my voice.

655
00:49:49,229 --> 00:49:52,329
Someone must have doctored it,
just like Chairman Kang Jae Gyeong's recording.

656
00:49:52,329 --> 00:49:55,090
My secretary acted on his own
out of some twisted loyalty,

657
00:49:55,090 --> 00:49:56,430
and now he's pinning it on me!

658
00:49:56,430 --> 00:49:59,872
We'll see about that
when we get you two in the same room.

659
00:49:59,872 --> 00:50:01,305
We've also put out a red notice,

660
00:50:01,305 --> 00:50:03,729
so you'll be reuniting
with your daughter very soon.

661
00:50:03,729 --> 00:50:05,139
I didn't know anything!

662
00:50:05,139 --> 00:50:07,030
I am innocent!

663
00:50:07,030 --> 00:50:09,839
Take your hands off me!

664
00:50:09,839 --> 00:50:11,670
Are you kidding me right now?

665
00:50:16,600 --> 00:50:20,012
<i>Following a surprise raid on Taeha Group,</i>

666
00:50:20,012 --> 00:50:23,649
<i>police are tracking down
the 300 billion won corporate loan</i>

667
00:50:23,649 --> 00:50:26,018
<i>Taeha took out to ostensibly acquire</i>

668
00:50:26,018 --> 00:50:28,086
<i>Choiseong Trading's hydrogen rights,</i>

669
00:50:28,086 --> 00:50:30,522
<i>which they stole without paying the balance.</i>

670
00:50:30,522 --> 00:50:34,059
<i>Authorities also plan
to work closely with Singapore,</i>

671
00:50:34,059 --> 00:50:37,996
<i>where Chairman Na allegedly
hid his slush funds.</i>

672
00:50:40,299 --> 00:50:44,670
<i>Meanwhile, the whereabouts
of Na Eun Se, the prime suspect</i>

673
00:50:44,670 --> 00:50:47,306
<i>in the murder of late Choiseong Chairman Kang,
remain unknown.</i>

674
00:50:47,306 --> 00:50:50,709
<i>Chairman Na, currently under investigation,</i>

675
00:50:50,709 --> 00:50:54,379
<i>has reportedly stated that</i>

676
00:50:54,379 --> 00:50:56,372
<i>his daughter acted entirely on her own.</i>

677
00:50:56,372 --> 00:50:58,939
<i>Eun Se is no longer a daughter of mine.</i>

678
00:50:58,939 --> 00:51:01,787
<i>I'll drag her in myself,
expose her crimes to the world,</i>

679
00:51:01,787 --> 00:51:04,256
<i>and make sure she gets what she deserves.</i>

680
00:51:06,206 --> 00:51:07,672
<i>Eun Se,</i>

681
00:51:07,672 --> 00:51:09,006
<i>are you okay?</i>

682
00:51:09,006 --> 00:51:10,632
<i>We got completely played.</i>

683
00:51:10,632 --> 00:51:11,566
<i>Hwang Jun Hyeon, that bastard...</i>

684
00:51:11,566 --> 00:51:13,999
<i>Don't come back to Korea for a while.</i>

685
00:51:15,167 --> 00:51:16,201
<i>What?</i>

686
00:51:16,201 --> 00:51:20,672
<i>Go straight to Florida
and lay low at the villa.</i>

687
00:51:20,672 --> 00:51:21,808
<i>Dad...</i>

688
00:51:21,808 --> 00:51:24,546
<i>It's the best way to do damage control.</i>

689
00:51:24,546 --> 00:51:26,712
<i>Without hard evidence or a suspect,</i>

690
00:51:26,712 --> 00:51:28,914
<i>the investigation will just fizzle out.</i>

691
00:51:28,914 --> 00:51:31,405
<i>Just do as you're told for now.</i>

692
00:51:31,405 --> 00:51:33,421
<i>That's how we both survive.</i>

693
00:51:33,421 --> 00:51:35,888
<i>You hear me?</i>

694
00:51:35,888 --> 00:51:37,608
<i>Eun Se.</i>

695
00:51:37,608 --> 00:51:38,768
<i>Eun Se!</i>

696
00:51:38,768 --> 00:51:40,859
<i>Na Eun Se!</i>

697
00:51:40,859 --> 00:51:43,872
<i>He sounds desperate for a guy
selling out his own daughter.</i>

698
00:51:43,872 --> 00:51:45,072
<i>Shut up.</i>

699
00:51:45,072 --> 00:51:46,588
<i>Fine.</i>

700
00:51:46,588 --> 00:51:48,800
<i>Go ahead and play the martyr.</i>

701
00:51:48,800 --> 00:51:50,739
<i>Take the fall for him all by yourself.</i>

702
00:51:50,739 --> 00:51:52,871
<i>I said shut up!</i>

703
00:52:11,580 --> 00:52:15,454
It's either she goes down,
or she takes her father down.

704
00:52:15,454 --> 00:52:17,415
Must be quite the dilemma for her.

705
00:52:17,415 --> 00:52:19,255
She just watched him throw her to the wolves.

706
00:52:19,255 --> 00:52:21,933
She's probably just figuring out
how to take him down.

707
00:52:31,438 --> 00:52:32,714
Yes, Chairman.

708
00:52:32,714 --> 00:52:34,906
Why are you so hard to reach?

709
00:52:34,906 --> 00:52:37,253
I just landed.

710
00:52:37,253 --> 00:52:39,033
I'll head straight back to the office.

711
00:52:39,033 --> 00:52:41,389
We have a lot to talk about.

712
00:52:41,389 --> 00:52:43,588
Alright.

713
00:52:48,039 --> 00:52:49,893
Can I get you something to eat?

714
00:52:49,893 --> 00:52:51,353
You haven't had dinner yet.

715
00:52:51,353 --> 00:52:53,519
I'm not hungry.

716
00:52:53,519 --> 00:52:55,513
You should head home too.

717
00:52:55,513 --> 00:52:57,872
And tell the task force to call it a day.

718
00:52:57,872 --> 00:52:59,304
Well...

719
00:53:09,740 --> 00:53:11,983
Did Jae Seong leave for the day?

720
00:53:35,672 --> 00:53:37,472
Call me if anything happens.

721
00:53:37,472 --> 00:53:39,314
Don't try to be a hero.

722
00:53:39,314 --> 00:53:41,313
Stop nagging and get going.

723
00:53:41,313 --> 00:53:43,878
Call me, no matter how late it is.

724
00:53:43,878 --> 00:53:45,350
Got it?

725
00:53:47,853 --> 00:53:50,188
Please drive safely.

726
00:53:51,218 --> 00:53:52,991
You promised, okay?

727
00:55:03,806 --> 00:55:06,676
Not enough evidence?

728
00:55:06,676 --> 00:55:09,556
Or just a killer legal team?

729
00:55:09,556 --> 00:55:12,240
Didn't expect you to be out this fast.

730
00:55:12,240 --> 00:55:15,496
I am the head
of a major conglomerate, after all.

731
00:55:15,496 --> 00:55:17,245
Though I admit, I was surprised myself.

732
00:55:17,245 --> 00:55:20,578
It's the first time
I've been stabbed in the back this hard.

733
00:55:26,806 --> 00:55:31,760
You stabbed your own daughter in the back
just to save your own neck.

734
00:55:31,760 --> 00:55:32,772
Cut the bullshit.

735
00:55:32,772 --> 00:55:34,425
What?

736
00:55:36,472 --> 00:55:39,631
That stench doesn't wash off easily, does it?

737
00:55:40,732 --> 00:55:45,971
Doesn't matter how much designer crap you wear
or how fancy your chair is.

738
00:55:45,971 --> 00:55:48,340
Your filthy habits never change.

739
00:55:48,340 --> 00:55:49,941
You little bastard!

740
00:55:54,139 --> 00:55:59,431
That look in your eyes,
running your mouth with zero fear...

741
00:55:59,431 --> 00:56:02,020
you're exactly like him.

742
00:56:02,906 --> 00:56:05,089
Don't you recognize me?

743
00:56:06,115 --> 00:56:07,759
It's me.

744
00:56:08,639 --> 00:56:11,396
Kang Yong Ho. The man you murdered.

745
00:56:17,206 --> 00:56:22,001
You knew you couldn't beat me
unless you killed me!

746
00:56:22,001 --> 00:56:23,675
Aren't you ashamed?

747
00:56:23,675 --> 00:56:25,877
Causing all this chaos
just to plant a flag on my grave

748
00:56:25,877 --> 00:56:28,179
and pat yourself on the back?

749
00:56:30,072 --> 00:56:32,417
Glory is fleeting,
and it all ends when you die.

750
00:56:32,417 --> 00:56:34,089
What more could you possibly want?

751
00:56:34,089 --> 00:56:35,853
You little prick!

752
00:56:37,839 --> 00:56:41,126
You think I don't see right through you?

753
00:56:41,126 --> 00:56:46,598
Using naive Bang Geul to swallow up Choiseong
out of some petty revenge? I respect that.

754
00:56:46,598 --> 00:56:51,139
I like that kind of ambition.

755
00:56:51,139 --> 00:56:56,040
Too bad... you're not on my side.

756
00:57:06,006 --> 00:57:08,019
Say hi...

757
00:57:08,705 --> 00:57:10,722
to Kang Yong Ho for me.

758
00:57:45,438 --> 00:57:47,692
Why is he calling instead of coming up?

759
00:57:56,037 --> 00:57:58,507
[Dad]

760
00:58:06,878 --> 00:58:08,952
[Missed call: Dad]

761
00:58:21,539 --> 00:58:25,008
<i>You ruled the world long enough, didn't you?</i>

762
00:58:25,008 --> 00:58:27,472
<i>How long are you going to block my path?</i>

763
00:58:27,472 --> 00:58:29,695
<i>What's still holding you here?</i>

764
00:58:29,695 --> 00:58:33,538
<i>Should I... end it for you?</i>

765
00:59:06,071 --> 00:59:10,507
[Chairman Kang Jae Gyeong]

766
00:59:30,232 --> 00:59:32,092
Dad...

